==English==
{{wikipedia}}
===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[percentage]] [[point]]}}

# one [[hundredth]] of a given value, used to measure the [[difference]] of two [[percentage]]s. For example, the difference between 20 [[percent]] and 30 percent is 10 percentage points, not 10 percent.

